# Private terms removed from transcripts before they are committed.
#
# Copy to redact_terms.txt (gitignored) and fill in. The real file is NOT
# committed: a published list of the things being hidden would publish them.
#
# One term per line, case-insensitive, matched as a literal substring.
# Include account names, employer names, project codenames, and anything else
# that is private but has no distinctive shape for the pattern matcher to find.

# employer-name
# work-github-username
# internal-project-codename
